      "High-solids formula builds good thickness in a single coat",
      "Good hot tire resistance in our testing after proper cure",
      "One-coat system saves a full day compared to primer-plus-topcoat kits"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Short working time of roughly 20 minutes once the pouch is activated",
      "Coverage per kit is limited, so larger garages need careful quantity planning"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The most foolproof mixing system here, wrapped around genuinely durable chemistry. Just have your plan ready before you break the pouch.",
